 * (`/messages` is appended). This is NOT the chat-completions base
 * (`https://api.deepseek.com`) `@deepseek-ai/dsh-llm-deepseek` uses, so this
 * provider does NOT reuse `$DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL` — only the API key is shared.
 */
